  Idle --> Candidate : EMA > cutoff
  Candidate --> Idle : EMA < cutoff
  Candidate --> Tier1 : held for confirm time
  Tier1 --> Tier2 : persists 5 s or 3 events in 5 min
  Tier2 --> Tier3 : persists 10 s or eyes closed 1.5 s
  Tier1 --> Cooldown : cue ends
  Tier2 --> Cooldown : cue ends
  Tier3 --> Cooldown : cue ends
  Cooldown --> Idle : 30 s elapsed
  Idle --> Suppressed : camera blocked
  Suppressed --> Idle : view clear
